      "level": "B1",
      "topics": ["travel"],
      "title": "A trip to Lisbon",
      "text": "Last summer, my friends and I travelled to Lisbon. Although our flight was delayed for two hours, we arrived in time for dinner. We had booked a small room near the river. On the second day we got lost in the old town, but a friendly local showed us the way back. When I was a child, I used to think Portugal was very far away, but now it feels like a second home.",
